# MySQL

The `mysql` recipe adds `internal/infrastructure/database` using
`database/sql` and the go-sql-driver/mysql driver.

- Read configuration with `database.ConfigFromEnv()` (requires `DATABASE_URL` in MySQL DSN format).
- Open the pool with `database.Open(ctx)` from the composition root, not from handlers.
- Close the pool during graceful shutdown.
- Keep SQL in feature/infrastructure adapters; do not add an ORM.
- Use `?` placeholders and always pass `context.Context`.
- Use `parseTime=true` when scanning timestamps into `time.Time`.
- See `.agents/skills/mysql/SKILL.md` for the full pattern.
